2,{"url":47},"./images/symbols/item-2.svg",{"link":29,"scale":19,"logo":49},{"url":50},"./images/symbols/item-3.svg",{"title":52,"subtitle":53,"items":54},"Spaces, Thoughtfully Designed","From the first idea to the final detail, make room for better living.",[55,59],{"id":56,"title":57,"text":58},"AB9S7MTMRWiTAOpkAC3c9A","Space Planning","<p>Reimagine the way your space works.</p>",{"id":60,"title":61,"text":62},"JWyJXpdtQk2Ba6cYJeJx4w","Residential Design","<p>Earn an upfront premium payment<br>from concept through to the finishing touches.</p>",{"texts":64},{"title":65,"subtitle":66,"text":67,"links":68},"The Forma Philosophy","Beautiful spaces begin with you.","<p dir=\"ltr\">Your routines, aspirations, and sense of style shape every design decision. We bring space, materials, and light together to create interiors that feel distinctly yours.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">From considered layouts to the objects you touch every day, our approach balances lasting beauty with everyday function.</p>\n<p><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-c950744a-7fff-99db-859f-916bd2ba037f\"></b></p>",[69],{"id":70,"label":71,"internal":19,"external":72},"W4Ra-iJlQkuFzjo0SOh1dw","Learn More","/#home-sfi",{"texts":74},{"title":75,"subtitle":8,"text":76,"links":77},"Our Design Services","<p>Forma Interiors is a design studio for homes, workplaces, and welcoming commercial spaces. We shape each project around its people, combining space planning, material selection, lighting, and bespoke details into one considered whole.</p>",[78],{"id":79,"label":80,"internal":19,"external":81},"JzYH3tePRTSSjlgvxCwUtw","Explore Services","/#home-vaults",{"logos":83,"texts":107,"title2":29},[84,88,91,95,98,101,104],{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":86},"/#home-audits",{"url":87},"./images/symbols/item-4.svg",{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":89},{"url":90},"./images/symbols/item-5.svg",{"link":85,"scale":92,"logo":93},1.25,{"url":94},"./images/symbols/item-6.svg",{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":96},{"url":97},"./images/symbols/item-7.svg",{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":99},{"url":100},"./images/symbols/item-8.svg",{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":102},{"url":103},"./images/symbols/item-9.svg",{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":105},{"url":106},"./images/symbols/item-10.svg",{"title":108,"subtitle":109,"text":110,"links":111},"Considered Details. Lasting Quality.","From the first layout to the final finish, every decision should serve the space. Explore how thoughtful planning and careful coordination bring a design together.","<p><span>We consider proportions, circulation, lighting, and material performance together. Samples and drawings help make decisions tangible, while an agreed brief keeps the project focused. The result is a cohesive space designed for daily life, with details that reward a closer look.&nbsp;</span></p>",[112],{"id":113,"label":114,"internal":19,"external":85},"CsaapURBTEybIb4R-71W2Q","Our Process",{"items":116},[117,120,123],{"id":118,"text":119},"aCCwXnCrRBm0_yiZZVD20Q","<p><span>Every project begins with a conversation about how you live, what you value, and how your space could work better.</span></p>",{"id":121,"text":122},"VjQtUGNOT6SCXS6waIorDg","<p><span>We translate that understanding into layouts, material palettes, and lighting ideas, refining the details together before work begins.&nbsp;</span></p>",{"id":124,"text":125},"XhhuuIBdREG7Hup4kxke5Q","<p><span>A considered handover brings the design together, with practical guidance for settling into your finished space.</span></p>",{"texts":127,"list":139},{"title":128,"subtitle":129,"text":29,"links":130},"Designed Around Your Life","Your ideas guide the process. We listen closely, share our thinking, and develop a space that reflects your needs and personality.",[131,135],{"id":132,"label":133,"internal":19,"external":134},"TJa8caCQRmmsZXTW7NILVQ","Our Studio","/#home-governance",{"id":136,"label":137,"internal":19,"external":138},"AD5LD5XPSYmO9Q0Gi-gDxw","Our Process","/#home-governance",[140,144,148],{"id":141,"title":142,"text":143},"OZuSDxoMQkKjk3E9kN3QCg","Personal","<div>\n<div><span>Your needs shape the brief, from the flow of each room to the pieces that make it feel like home.</span></div>\n</div>",{"id":145,"title":146,"text":147},"UGvHzB8_ST6vEtueqnWLHw","Transparent","<div>\n<div><span>Clear drawings, material choices, and agreed priorities help you understand the design and make confident decisions.</span></div>\n</div>",{"id":149,"title":150,"text":151},"Q0gP2ItqTVutQ4G3AktBxg","Enduring","<div>\n<div><span>Adaptable layouts and carefully chosen materials create spaces that can evolve with the way you live.</span></div>\n</div>",{"title":153,"subtitle":154},"Forma Journal","Explore ideas on thoughtful spaces, natural materials, lighting, and the details that make a room feel complete.",{"title":156,"link":157,"items":164},"Frequently\nasked\nquestions",{"id":158,"label":159,"internal":160,"external":29},"NqFwGja3QtGWWK6FmzH2_g","View All",{"id":161,"type":162,"title":163},"GjtTyVzNQhePUmjxRkss-Q","faq_index","FAQ",[165,169,173,176],{"id":166,"question":167,"answer":168},"Zsh_vz6vR_WjF4bNKhwF5A","What can Forma Interiors help with?","<div>\n<div><span>We help shape residential and commercial interiors through space planning, material palettes, lighting, furniture selection, and bespoke details. The scope is tailored to your project.</span></div>\n</div>",{"id":170,"question":171,"answer":172},"WCk-4ndeTs6SXw9mHlseUw","What should I consider before starting a project?","<div>\n<div><span>Think about how you use your space, your priorities, your budget, and your preferred timeline. Existing plans, photographs, and a few references can help communicate what matters to you.</span></div>\n</div>",{"id":174,"question":175,"answer":76},"fScSPOUpQ6iluzvorbugGg","What is Forma Interiors and how do you work?",{"id":177,"question":178,"answer":179},"LXDjU2BsRWm74EaScIVWcQ","How do I get started with my interior project?","<div>\n<div><span>Start with a brief: the spaces you want to improve, your goals, a budget range, and a preferred timeline. These details provide a foundation for discussing a suitable design scope.&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>",{"texts":181,"items":189},{"title":182,"subtitle":183,"text":29,"links":184},"Make Room for Inspiration","Discover room-by-room ideas, material guides, studio notes, and conversations about design in the Forma Journal.",[185],{"id":186,"label":187,"internal":188,"external":16},"FhfKnD8kRJWR0CbWmE9uqA","Start Your Project",{"id":13,"type":14,"title":15},[190,200,211],{"id":191,"title":192,"text":193,"link":194},"VgC62lK7SGGZVBDRO5aw3w","Design Conversations","Explore the ideas, materials, and everyday rituals that shape meaningful interiors.",{"id":195,"label":71,"internal":196,"external":29},"C8qJ9ahxTDegIAs7CBjcEg",{"id":197,"type":198,"title":199},"Iy0MEGeTSSecahRuScDSJQ","academy_index","Journal",{"id":201,"title":202,"text":203,"link":204},"HlAJGOsnTjKiTERrdeubuQ","Forma Studio","Discover the visual language of Forma Interiors: a considered palette and a shared appreciation for thoughtful details.",{"id":205,"label":206,"internal":207,"external":29},"QfE36TGNQ_uqHm0fCaKzLQ","Explore Our Identity",{"id":208,"type":209,"title":210},"JHStYRSnS5KZDNTfKwyjAQ","brand","Brand",{"id":212,"title":213,"text":214,"link":215},"SUWpmkJPRQemQAU-9im_Cg","Design Guide","Find practical guidance on the design process, preparing a brief, and planning your next project.",{"id":216,"label":71,"internal":19,"external":217},"UNzHFlW6TBieHkQt-gMvFw","/faq",{"page":219,"posts":221,"_allAcademiesMeta":352},{"hero":220,"seo":19},{"title":153,"subtitle":154},[222,233,244,255,266,277,299,321,331],{"published":223,"id":224,"date":225,"slug":226,"title":227,"excerpt":228,"podcast":229,"thumbnail":19,"cat":19},"2026-06-17T20:41:23.668+01:00","LP6CYe4ASdWpKo4n7mR89Q","2026-05-07","the-bill-that-might-actually-move","A Home That Moves With You","Flexible layouts make everyday living easier. Explore how thoughtful zoning, adaptable furniture, and considered storage can help a home evolve with its people.",{"file":230,"episode":232},{"url":231},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1781725262-saffron-files-5-7-26.mp3",9,{"published":234,"id":235,"date":236,"slug":237,"title":238,"excerpt":239,"podcast":240,"thumbnail":19,"cat":19},"2026-06-08T13:54:29.579+01:00","bucSoFWPSkeqS2EBoMdDoA","2026-04-21","trust-isnt-given-its-earned","The Beauty of Honest Materials","Wood grain, natural stone, and tactile textiles bring depth to an interior. Discover how to choose materials for the way they look, feel, and age.",{"file":241,"episode":243},{"url":242},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1780923061-saffron-files-4-21-26_episode_7.mp3",8,{"published":245,"id":246,"date":247,"slug":248,"title":249,"excerpt":250,"podcast":251,"thumbnail":19,"cat":19},"2026-06-08T13:54:09.456+01:00","SCOc9fstQ-e5Z_XDR8Ruzw","2026-04-11","never-blindly-sign-even-from-friends","Before You Begin Your Renovation","A clear brief creates a better starting point. Consider priorities, measurements, practical constraints, and the questions to ask before your project takes shape.",{"file":252,"episode":254},{"url":253},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1780923063-saffron-files-4-11-26_episode_6.mp3",7,{"published":256,"id":257,"date":258,"slug":259,"title":260,"excerpt":261,"podcast":262,"thumbnail":19,"cat":19},"2026-07-16T19:37:36.423+01:00","JLSgifPvS--3r6G6HRvOpw","2026-03-30","is-bitcoin-even-a-hedge-anymore","Creating a Calm Everyday Retreat","A restful room is shaped by more than colour. Explore proportion, layered light, gentle textures, and the value of leaving space to breathe.",{"file":263,"episode":265},{"url":264},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1784226943-saffron-files-3-30-26.wav",6,{"published":267,"id":268,"date":269,"slug":270,"title":271,"excerpt":272,"podcast":273,"thumbnail":19,"cat":19},"2026-06-08T13:53:54.706+01:00","FjoPoB5DQq2oqfwbNmYpiw","2026-03-22","is-private-credit-cooked","The Kitche